                    <h5>8 June 2024</h5>
                    <h3>Why we adjusted interest rates</h3>
                    <p>The ECB has cut interest rates. President Christine Lagarde explains why and sets out what still needs to be done to bring inflation back to 2% over the medium term.</p>
                </a>
