		</div><div class="box"><a class="content-box"  href="/press/blog/date/2023/html/ecb.blog230824~362178a805.en.html">
                    <div data-image="/press/blog/date/2023/html//ecb.blog230824~362178a805/ecb.blog230824~362178a805.jpg"></div>
                    <h5>24 August 2023</h5>
                    <h3>What makes a good banknote? </h3>
                    <p>Our money needs to be easy to handle, appealing and difficult to counterfeit. This ECB Blog post talks you through good banknote design – and seeks your advice. </p>
                </a>
				<div class="ecb-langSelector"><span class="offeredLanguage"><a  class='arrow' lang="en" href="/press/blog/date/2023/html/ecb.blog230824~362178a805.en.html">
