                    <h5>28 June 2023</h5>
                    <h3>Why Europe needs a digital euro</h3>
                    <p>Contribution by Fabio Panetta, Member of the Executive Board of the ECB, and Valdis Dombrovskis, Executive Vice-President of the European Commission</p>
                </a>
				<div class="ecb-langSelector"><span class="offeredLanguage"><a  class='arrow' lang="en" href="/press/blog/date/2023/html/ecb.blog230628~140c43d2f3.en.html">
