                    <h5>13 July 2022</h5>
                    <h3>Key objectives of the digital euro</h3>
                    <p>It is our responsibility to preserve the integrity of the monetary and payment systems, write President Christine Lagarde and Executive Board member Fabio Panetta. A digital euro could play a decisive role in this endeavour.</p>
                </a>
				<div class="ecb-langSelector"><span class="offeredLanguage"><a  class='arrow' lang="en" href="/press/blog/date/2022/html/ecb.blog220713~34e21c3240.en.html">
