                    <h5>8 July 2022</h5>
                    <h3>A catalyst for greening the financial system </h3>
                    <p>The ECB is reducing the carbon footprint in its portfolio and pushing banks to better manage climate risks. Within our mandate, we incorporate climate change considerations into our monetary policy and banking supervision, say Frank Elderson and Isabel Schnabel.</p>
