                    <h5>23 May 2022</h5>
                    <h3>Monetary policy normalisation in the euro area</h3>
                    <p>As the expected date of interest rate lift-off draws closer, it gets more important to clarify the path of policy normalisation ahead of us – especially given the complex environment that monetary policy in the euro area is facing, says President Christine Lagarde in The ECB Blog.</p>
                </a>
