                    <h5>19 November 2021</h5>
                    <h3>The ECB’s case for central bank digital currencies</h3>
                    <p>To continue playing its role as the anchor of the monetary system, central bank money will need to respond to evolving needs, says Executive Board member Fabio Panetta. This means that we must intensify the work on central bank digital currencies.</p>
                </a>
