                    <h5>4 November 2021</h5>
                    <h3>Charting a course for climate action</h3>
                    <p>The COP26 summit is a vital opportunity to set out a clear path towards a zero-carbon world, President Lagarde writes in a blog post. While the road ahead may seem daunting, she argues that a credible transition path will need clear signposts to break it up into more manageable stages.</p>
