                    <h5>31 August 2021</h5>
                    <h3>Climate change and monetary policy</h3>
                    <p>The existential threat posed by climate change implies that central banks must not stand on the sidelines in the fight against global warming, writes Executive Board member Isabel Schnabel. Our ambitious climate action plan outlines how the ECB will contribute within its mandate.</p>
                </a>
				<div class="ecb-langSelector"><span class="offeredLanguage"><a  class='arrow' lang="en" href="/press/blog/date/2021/html/ecb.blog210831~3a7cecbf52.en.html">
