                    <h3>The new monetary policy strategy: implications for rate forward guidance</h3>
                    <p>Our revised forward guidance is a fundamental step in fulfilling our commitment to 2% inflation, writes Chief Economist Philip R. Lane. He also discusses the three conditions that should be met before interest rates are raised.</p>
                </a>
				<div class="ecb-langSelector"><span class="offeredLanguage"><a  class='arrow' lang="en" href="/press/blog/date/2021/html/ecb.blog210819~c99d1b768d.en.html">
