                    <h5>27 July 2021</h5>
                    <h3>After the crisis: Economic lessons from the pandemic</h3>
                    <p>If we make the recovery fund work and if we embed the lessons from the pandemic in the EMU governance framework, we can emerge from the crisis with a stronger economy and greater social and political cohesion, says Executive Board member Fabio Panetta in The ECB Blog.</p>
                </a>
