                    <h5>14 July 2021</h5>
                    <h3>Preparing for the euro’s digital future</h3>
                    <p>We have decided to launch a project to prepare for possibly issuing a digital euro. A digital euro will be successful if it adds value for people, merchants and financial intermediaries in the euro area, explains Executive Board member Fabio Panetta in The ECB Blog.</p>
