                    <h5>11 May 2021</h5>
                    <h3>A global accord for sustainable finance</h3>
                    <p>Climate change and sustainability are global challenges that require global solutions, especially in the financial sector, writes Executive Board member Fabio Panetta. We need international disclosure standards and principles to categorise sustainable activities.</p>
                </a>
				<div class="ecb-langSelector"><span class="offeredLanguage"><a  class='arrow' lang="en" href="/press/blog/date/2021/html/ecb.blog210511~7810445372.en.html">
