                    <div data-image="/press/blog/date/2021/html//ecb.blog210401~6407b23d87/ecb.blog210401~6407b23d87.jpg"></div>
                    <h5>1 April 2021</h5>
                    <h3>Inflation dynamics during a pandemic</h3>
                    <p>The recent volatility of inflation can largely be attributed to the nature of the pandemic shock, writes Chief Economist Philip R. Lane. The increase in inflation during early 2021 does not constitute the basis for a sustained shift in inflation dynamics.</p>
