                    <h3>Choose to challenge women’s roles at home, at work and in our society</h3>
                    <p>One year into the pandemic, we can clearly see that the social and economic impact of the virus is particularly hard for women, writes President Christine Lagarde. In response we must choose to challenge women’s roles at home, at work and in our society.</p>
