		</div><div class="box"><a class="content-box"  href="/press/blog/date/2020/html/ecb.blog200403~54ecc5988b.en.html">
                    <div data-image="/press/blog/date/2020/html//ecb.blog200403~54ecc5988b/ecb.blog200403~54ecc5988b.jpg"></div>
                    <h5>3 April 2020</h5>
                    <h3>The ECB’s commercial paper purchases: A targeted response to the economic disturbances caused by COVID-19</h3>
                    <p>Commercial paper purchases are key for monetary policy transmission to the real economy, explain Vice-President Luis de Guindos and Executive Board member Isabel Schnabel in The ECB Blog. They ease financing conditions for firms and help them manage short-term funding needs.</p>
                </a>
				<div class="ecb-langSelector"><span class="offeredLanguage"><a  class='arrow' lang="en" href="/press/blog/date/2020/html/ecb.blog200403~54ecc5988b.en.html">
